import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.SheafHigherDirectImageStalk
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.SheafHigherDirectImageSheafification

/-!
# Native higher direct-image sheaves and their neighborhood stalk formula

This package constructs higher direct images by the genuine right-derived
native pushforward, and identifies their actual stalks with directed
colimits of the existing Ext-defined sheaf cohomology groups on inverse-
image neighborhoods. It also proves the corresponding sheafification
description. It does not assert a fibre comparison, Grauert's
theorem, or any particular higher-direct-image calculation.
-/
